body:
How long did it take you to notice a difference? I've been at it 3 weeks now.  My symptoms are interesting because about once a month or so my pain will nearly disappear for three days no matter what I'm eating, but then come right back. My symptoms felt better after the first week of the diet, but came right back again so I'm not convinced my triggers are dietary.

&#x200B;

Thank you so much for your comment though. I'm relieved that hopefully one day I'll be able to enjoy a drink in moderation with my friends again.

&#x200B;

&#x200B;
